 "sentences": [
  "Taylor Swift once became invisible in her music video.",
  "This track from her album Reputation is called Delicate.",
  "She wrote the song with producers Max Martin and Shellback.",
  "It features unique vocoder vocals and tropical house beats.",
  "The video shows her dancing barefoot through public places.",
  "Critics saw her invisibility as a metaphor for hiding from the press.",
  "She finally reappears after dancing in the pouring rain."
